ads/origins/01a662fd-bf57-4a71-9ca5-03fd65131b67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78a3353a17024a0b70fdda37273417a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c1d90d85/uploads/origins/01a662fd-bf57-4a71-9ca5-03fd65131b67?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4c2f9a223d35a71d37864ad29a11291 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you very much for the wonderful illustration from last time! May I request another illustration?\n\nCharacter >> https://sta.sh/211rjjkuhing?edit=1\n\nHe’s an easygoing, somewhat mischievous man who is a mafioso. He’s like a playful older brother type of character.\n\nIf it’s alright, I’ll leave the pose and composition up to you. Thank you for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hazimemasugozin/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8f6e9c7/uploads/origins/0b001b49-7761-4563-818d-960d609e5f40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df1c841c5eaba62492bb8c77b50bed68", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b8f6e9c7/uploads/origins/0b001b49-7761-4563-818d-960d609e5f40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df1c841c5eaba62492bb8c77b50bed68, https://si.imgix.net/b8f6e9c7/uploads/origins/0b001b49-7761-4563-818d-960d609e5f40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91ccd54840124ecfb7faabf6ceaa0860 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b8f6e9c7/uploads/origins/0b001b49-7761-4563-818d-960d609e5f40?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57c4a63f30cf5e9a570770c945ec6dcb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。あなたの作品が大好きです。もしよろしければ、私のキャラクターのイラストをお願いしたいのですが、いかがでしょうか？\n\n参考>> https://sta.sh/21wqjx3gqnfz?edit=1\n\n東京都在住のエクソシストです。性格はのんびりしていて明るい。流行に敏感で、かなりの人気者です。できれば、モダンで都会的なイメージで描いていただけると嬉しいです。でも、自由に描いていただいても構いません。ご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hazimemasugozin/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5de97509/requests/260963_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd0062369f093eb32859965f77cffe7d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5de97509/requests/260963_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd0062369f093eb32859965f77cffe7d, https://si.imgix.net/5de97509/requests/260963_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f0d87d3529a1ea9a9cd913bac8e2677 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5de97509/requests/260963_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=652fd8d32a91c546ab911112951e201d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello. I'd like to request a drawing of two characters.\n\nI would like to request these two characters looking like gangsters. Please add matching tattoos on the neck, chests and arms. the tattoos can be any design as long as they are the same. Make the characters hold weapons like a sword and guns. You can change the outfit into a loose black suit to show the tattoos. feel free to add accessories and more tattoos as you like. \n\nPlease make the theme dark and evil.\n\nI have a pet seal so feel free to add him in if you want.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/HpNO4LR", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hazimemasugozin/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/24e45338/requests/247460_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cb2141862f6dbe65d5d850be0699ab0d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/24e45338/requests/247460_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cb2141862f6dbe65d5d850be0699ab0d, https://si.imgix.net/24e45338/requests/247460_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompre